    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Zenithium Blocks is a collection of modern, performant, and interactive WordPress blocks designed to enhance your WordPress block editing experience.</p>\n<p>🔗 <strong>Live Demo:</strong> <a href=\"https://sabir.coderdevsbd.com/zenithium-blocks/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">View Zenithium Blocks Live Demo</a></p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Accessible Accordion &amp; FAQ</strong>: Expandable content blocks with customizable icons, auto-close behavior, and smooth toggling.</li>\n<li><strong>Modern Interactive Carousel</strong>: Fully responsive slider block with customizable slide alignments and smooth transitions.</li>\n<li><strong>Animated Stats Counter</strong>: Eye-catching numerical counter block with customizable prefix, suffix, and scroll animations.</li>\n<li><strong>Image Comparison Slider</strong>: Interactive before/after image comparison slider.</li>\n<li><strong>Floating Sticky CTA Bar</strong>: High-converting sticky call-to-action bar for driving conversions across devices.</li>\n<li><strong>Interactive Flip Card</strong>: Engaging 3D double-sided flip card block for showcasing products, features, or team members.</li>\n<li><strong>Lightweight &amp; Fast</strong>: Built using native WordPress block components (<code>@wordpress/block-editor</code>) with zero external bloat.</li>\n<li><strong>Full Site Editing (FSE) Ready</strong>: Seamlessly integrates with block themes and classic themes alike.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>zenithium-blocks</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or install directly via the WordPress plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open the WordPress Block editor on any page or post and search for <strong>Zenithium Blocks</strong> in the block inserter.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20zenithium%20blocks%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nDoes Zenithium Blocks work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! Zenithium Blocks is designed to work with all block themes (FSE) as well as classic themes that support block editor.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial official release.</li>\n<li>Added Accordion &amp; Accordion Group block.</li>\n<li>Added Modern Interactive Carousel block.</li>\n<li>Added Animated Stats Counter block.</li>\n<li>Added Image Comparison block.</li>\n<li>Added Floating Sticky CTA Bar block.</li>\n<li>Added Interactive Flip Card block.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "High-demand modern interactive block suite for the WordPress Block Editor.",
    "description": "<p>Zenithium Blocks is a collection of modern, performant, and interactive WordPress blocks designed to enhance your WordPress block editing experience.</p>\n<p>🔗 <strong>Live Demo:</strong> <a href=\"https://sabir.coderdevsbd.com/zenithium-blocks/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">View Zenithium Blocks Live Demo</a></p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Accessible Accordion &amp; FAQ</strong>: Expandable content blocks with customizable icons, auto-close behavior, and smooth toggling.</li>\n<li><strong>Modern Interactive Carousel</strong>: Fully responsive slider block with customizable slide alignments and smooth transitions.</li>\n<li><strong>Animated Stats Counter</strong>: Eye-catching numerical counter block with customizable prefix, suffix, and scroll animations.</li>\n<li><strong>Image Comparison Slider</strong>: Interactive before/after image comparison slider.</li>\n<li><strong>Floating Sticky CTA Bar</strong>: High-converting sticky call-to-action bar for driving conversions across devices.</li>\n<li><strong>Interactive Flip Card</strong>: Engaging 3D double-sided flip card block for showcasing products, features, or team members.</li>\n<li><strong>Lightweight &amp; Fast</strong>: Built using native WordPress block components (<code>@wordpress/block-editor</code>) with zero external bloat.</li>\n<li><strong>Full Site Editing (FSE) Ready</strong>: Seamlessly integrates with block themes and classic themes alike.</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/zenithium-blocks.1.0.0.zip",
